What does The Drop: A Snowfall Saga need to get right about LA culture? 🤔

@jeremy_hecht hit up the crowd at @fxnetworks and UPROXX’s celebration of ‘The Drop’ at the world-famous @officialviplb to get their take. The answers are straight from the people who know Los Angeles best.

FX’s The Drop: A Snowfall Saga is now streaming on @hulu. #FXPartner
